  "figureType": "diagram",
  "elements": [
    "incoming slow neutron sphere at far left, labeled ¹₀n",
    "impact flash lines where the neutron meets the U-235 nucleus",
    "U-235 nucleus rendered as a roughly spherical cluster of green and off-white nucleon spheres, labeled ²³⁵₉₂U",
    "rightward arrow from U-235 to the intermediate nucleus",
    "U-236 intermediate nucleus rendered as an elongated, pinched (dumbbell) cluster of nucleon spheres with a red instability outline, labeled ²³⁶₉₂U and 'Unstable nucleus'",
    "two diverging arrows from U-236 to the daughter nuclei",
    "Kr-92 daughter nucleus (smaller green/white sphere cluster) at upper right, labeled ⁹²₃₆Kr",
    "Ba-141 daughter nucleus (smaller green/white sphere cluster) at lower right, labeled ¹⁴¹₅₆Ba",
    "gold starburst shape between the daughters labeled 'Energy'",
    "three ejected neutron spheres at far right with arrows, labeled 3 ¹₀n",
    "bottom balanced nuclear equation: ²³⁵₉₂U + ¹₀n → ²³⁶₉₂U → ¹⁴¹₅₆Ba + ⁹²₃₆Kr + 3 ¹₀n with rightward arrows"
