    },
    {
      "id": "productInfo",
      "type": "click",
      "teaches": "Each product has a definite identity: the two heavy clusters are fission fragments (Ba-141, Kr-92) that do NOT continue the chain, while the three light spheres are neutrons that CAN trigger further fissions — distinguishing fragments from chain carriers"
